ther colors\". So including a distractor is good.\n\nLet me also consider: mostcolor must be 0. Count zeros: 9x9=81 cells. Blue square cells: 4*4=16, plus 1 distractor = 17. Zeros = 64. Most common 0. Good.\n\nI'll call show_transformed_input for these three.\n\nWait - should I worry the order matters? The tool computes output via verifier. Let me just submit.\n\nLet me finalize grids as lists of lists of ints.",
